From 4a36e0be881b0a7298efb7aaddda731525ce7816 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Johnny D <goforjohnny@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 30 May 2026 02:51:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] wasm: extract Bootstrap OS ops to build-tagged files

Extract os.MkdirAll/os.RemoveAll into prepareDataDir() and fsnotify hook
registration into registerNotifyWatcherHooks(). WASM build provides no-ops;
native build keeps the original behavior.
---
 core/base.go      | 49 ++---------------------------------------------
 core/base_unix.go | 23 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 core/base_wasm.go | 10 ++++++++++
 3 files changed, 35 insertions(+), 47 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 core/base_unix.go
 create mode 100644 core/base_wasm.go

diff --git a/core/base.go b/core/base.go
index e932eb1..446abab 100644
